  "body": "```\r\neledev-synapse_1  | 2021-07-13 01:12:03,141 - twisted - 258 - INFO - sentinel - SMTP Client retrying server. Retry: 4\r\neledev-synapse_1  | 2021-07-13 01:12:03,142 - twisted - 258 - INFO - sentinel - SMTP Client retrying server. Retry: 3\r\neledev-synapse_1  | 2021-07-13 01:12:03,143 - twisted - 258 - INFO - sentinel - SMTP Client retrying server. Retry: 2\r\neledev-synapse_1  | 2021-07-13 01:12:03,144 - twisted - 258 - INFO - sentinel - SMTP Client retrying server. Retry: 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe SMTP server in this setup was emitting Connection Refused back at Synapse. The `Retry` is backwards, and there's only a single millisecond between attempts.",
